      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `2bde6a478e623b80904c2c2a813ef0dfa2e033972cd9649c5ecb08716ee8a029--45130do003_200809.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2008-09\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 15 of 15\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 6890122e35d47e56989dbebd19f39726038b2cfd7665696e47fb9f46da00e3ae | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | ccded22a5a9dc33de59ea4cc258be45404d2701ef37871cc606d85b3fd41cac4 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 87f41910272311b35191ea754e3458711341e159e0e7758b378708409a5f3e69 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | bc34bc6267a0242c315ce62dd15cd72555f0953df3e99619babf5d32ea147d05 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 221a1deb0df922992f14c290043b6382633968662e0c86f3146d0d71ad7df5f2 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | c8a81567ce85c48f7647dd183c52dfa3330a6307318561ea6cf6573829c9a3b1 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 631f5f0201c4828815d4faf996100b77250631cb84d8d18bb615625108456cc2 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 836577a0ee0f18c0a50790f8d5d5df6ed12d560d16b827b9a0c91026452c8978 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 709687a89b9adc5cd02138402697c8aaad3dc1b304554031486e2693040e09c0 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 2fc45ff211b96c422ca653e0dd3fb257a54b5707cc0dcc98b2d534003a4e6728 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 1fef8c876ffaec881c892b8de967b613a86527848991786f0a56dfd8befc1914 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 72047697815c15b6fe5a90043713a7523905b69d77adee2a00ecc11507683d29 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 5760dadc6cc65518be5771447c13973dab756bbce4fd6886f743e922ebf153cf | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | edd3a46a4d7d708e05578a49058ae687b42f08d63ba4e0cdf6d86ba3487b9715 | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | c5635ab232fd9acbe5be35b8e7871bedfe3866cdc9cc15b5fcd3b145bb597f7e | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and che